[00:00.00] 作词 : Hiroki Morishita/Takeru Kanazaki/Yasuhisa Baba/Rei Kondoh/Masato Kouda
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Hiroki Morishita/Takeru Kanazaki/Yasuhisa Baba/Rei Kondoh/Masato Kouda
[00:16.47] You are the ocean's gray waves, destined to seek (你是大海的灰浪，注定要去寻找)
[00:23.45] Life beyond the shore just out of reach (那遥不可及的人生)
[00:28.82] Yet the waters ever change, flowing like time (水像时间一样流动，永无止息)
[00:35.62] The path is yours to climb (这是你将要攀登的狭路)
[00:40.24] In the white light, a hand reaches through (一只手从白光中穿过)
[00:48.96] A double-edged blade cuts your heart in two (双刃剑将你的心一分为二)
[00:54.12] Waking dreams fade away, (白日的梦想逐渐散去)
[00:57.03] Embrace the brand-new day (拥抱全新的一天)
[01:04.55] Sing with me a song of birthrights and love (和我一起唱起权利与爱之歌)
[01:11.85] The light scatters to the sky above (光从天上散射四处)
[01:16.70] Dawn breaks through the gloom, white as a bone (黎明冲破黑暗，苍白如骨)
[01:23.55] Lost in thoughts all alone (独自沉浸在思绪之中)
[01:31.75] You are the ocean's gray waves, destined to seek (你是大海的灰浪，注定要去寻找)
[01:38.70] Life beyond the shore just out of reach (那遥不可及的人生)
[01:43.76] Yet the waters ever change, flowing like time (水像时间一样流动，永无止息)
[01:50.70] The path is yours to climb (这将是你要攀登的狭路)
[01:55.17] Embrace the dark you call a home, (拥抱那被你称为“家”的黑暗)
[02:04.36] Gaze upon an empty, white throne (凝视着虚无的白色王座)
[02:08.94] A legacy of lies, (谎言遗留)
[02:12.00] A familiar disguise (熟悉伪装)
[02:19.67] Sing with me a song of conquest and fate (和我一起唱起征服与命运之歌)
[02:26.68] The black pillar cracks beneath its weight (黑色支柱在重压下破碎)
[02:31.60] Night breaks through the day, hard as a stone (黑夜冲破白昼，坚如磐石)
[02:38.60] Lost in thoughts all alone (独自沉浸在思绪之中)
[02:43.39] The path you walk on belongs to destiny, just let it flow (你所攀登的道路属于命运，请你顺其自然)
[02:54.27] All of your joy and your pain will fall like the tide, let it flow (所有的欢乐与痛苦都将随潮水褪去，请你顺其自然)
[03:07.70] Life is not just filled with happiness, or sorrow (人生不仅是充满着快乐或悲伤)
[03:18.34] Even the thorn in your heart, in time it may become a rose (即使是你心中的荆刺，在时间的照料下它也终会长出玫瑰)
[03:29.34]
[03:52.16] A burdened heart sinks into the ground (沉重的心坠入地下)
[04:01.30] A veil falls away without a sound (面纱无声地掉落)
[04:06.03] Not day nor night, wrong nor right (不分昼夜，不论对错)
[04:08.98] For truth and peace you fight (请为了真理与和平而战)
[04:16.50] Sing with me a song of silence and blood (和我一起唱起沉默与鲜血之歌)
[04:23.65] The rain falls, but can't wash away the mud (雨水倾盆落下，却无法洗净污泥)
[04:28.61] Within my ancient heart dwells madness and pride (疯狂与骄傲存在于我古老的内心中)
[04:35.66] Can no one hear my cry (没有人聆听我的悲泣)
[04:40.64] You are the ocean's gray waves, destined to seek (你是大海的灰浪，注定要去寻找)
[04:47.57] Life beyond the shore, just out of reach (那遥不可及的人生)
[04:52.57] Yet the waters ever change, flowing like time (水像时间一样流动，永无止息)
[04:59.69] The path is yours to climb (这是你将要攀登的狭路)
